{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/1775af63959b2ad4e036af72035ddfaa.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/1775af63959b2ad4e036af72035ddfaa.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/1775af63959b2ad4e036af72035ddfaa.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Play as a survivor in this open world return to the iconic Terminator universe set in the aftermath of Judgment Day.</strong><br><br>Four years have passed since the day humanity almost disappeared. The truth behind this apocalyptic event has yet to be uncovered. You emerge from a shelter to try and re-establish a semblance of society, only to discover a world ravaged by Skynet, who seem hell-bent on eliminating you and the last remnants of humanity. <br><br>Fight the first Skynet prototypes and help the Resistance rise from the ashes of civilization. But beware, the legendary T-800 is after you, and staying in one place for too long could prove fatal.<br>Investigate and discover the truth behind the nuclear apocalypse, Skynet and the Terminator threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/fc045797a0e1b035e304914122084111.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/fc045797a0e1b035e304914122084111.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/fc045797a0e1b035e304914122084111.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet iconic characters of the franchise as well as original ones and immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted world set in the post-apocalyptic future of James Cameron\u2019s masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/2c612cac59aeb8488abe89fbae4107aa.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/2c612cac59aeb8488abe89fbae4107aa.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/2c612cac59aeb8488abe89fbae4107aa.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/d2864b3d48a556c1daa65fdb623bafd7.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/d2864b3d48a556c1daa65fdb623bafd7.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/d2864b3d48a556c1daa65fdb623bafd7.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight formidable sophisticated machines and stop skynet from eradicating humanity again, but never forget: The fearsome and deadly Terminator is out there, hunting you, and a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/5b0fee6fed84929440ae0dcea7e5eb44.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/5b0fee6fed84929440ae0dcea7e5eb44.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/5b0fee6fed84929440ae0dcea7e5eb44.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/c8b47a1eb59cb38397ddf4a82939c329.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/c8b47a1eb59cb38397ddf4a82939c329.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/c8b47a1eb59cb38397ddf4a82939c329.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about what happened on Judgment Day in an unexplored storyline and try to change humanity\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/35c643b3716c550b15cf75f95b1d9478.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/35c643b3716c550b15cf75f95b1d9478.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/35c643b3716c550b15cf75f95b1d9478.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/f6f934ce519f9a1ce2aac7f140087c47.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/f6f934ce519f9a1ce2aac7f140087c47.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/f6f934ce519f9a1ce2aac7f140087c47.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from the remnants of the old world at a home base you\u2019ll use to establish a new foothold for humanity and stand tall against the machine threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/523ae3aadb610d775ef7d1d4574c9f6a.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/523ae3aadb610d775ef7d1d4574c9f6a.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/523ae3aadb610d775ef7d1d4574c9f6a.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/ba26f6821b51e9b32f33fa9bf2a65627.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/ba26f6821b51e9b32f33fa9bf2a65627.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/ba26f6821b51e9b32f33fa9bf2a65627.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you\u2019ll be armed to attack up close and at range, stealth and caution may be more intelligent approaches with Skynet\u2019s machines and scavengers lurking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/3e98a7a0cf2338a3a2146513eaa4a875.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/3e98a7a0cf2338a3a2146513eaa4a875.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/3e98a7a0cf2338a3a2146513eaa4a875.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgro