 in one place for too long could prove fatal.<br>Investigate and discover the truth behind the nuclear apocalypse, Skynet and the Terminator threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/a7b254d386d42c7855d83dcae76e151c.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/fc045797a0e1b035e304914122084111.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/fc045797a0e1b035e304914122084111.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/fc045797a0e1b035e304914122084111.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet iconic characters of the franchise as well as original ones and immerse yourself in a meticulously crafted world set in the post-apocalyptic future of James Cameron\u2019s masterpiece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/2c612cac59aeb8488abe89fbae4107aa.poster.avif