raph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/c8b47a1eb59cb38397ddf4a82939c329.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/c8b47a1eb59cb38397ddf4a82939c329.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/c8b47a1eb59cb38397ddf4a82939c329.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about what happened on Judgment Day in an unexplored storyline and try to change humanity\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/35c643b3716c550b15cf75f95b1d9478.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/35c643b3716c550b15cf75f95b1d9478.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/35c643b3716c550b15cf75f95b1d9478.mp4?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/f6f934ce519f9a1ce2aac7f140087c47.poster.avif?t=1769074182\" width=614 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2617340/extras/f6f934ce519f9a1ce2aac7f140087c47.webm?t=1769074182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared